WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.060
P3.1 · Versions and what they freeze

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.498
Each month you close is kept as a version, named after its period.

3
00:00:09.548 --> 00:00:14.550
It holds the ledger, the statements, the forecast and the KPIs as they stood.

4
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.215
Pick an earlier version in the first box of the top bar.

5
00:00:19.265 --> 00:00:26.071
Every page then shows the situation at that close: what the forecast said in June, what the DSO was.

6
00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:39.083
Budgets are a separate thing, with their own versions: here FY2026, approved, next to the FY2027 and FY2028 drafts.

7
00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:43.957
Each budget goes through an approval workflow: draft, submitted, approved.

8
00:00:45.407 --> 00:00:49.298
Next: P3.2  Creating a budget from actuals

